# URL that accepts the contact form as a JSON POST (your own endpoint, or a
# form service such as Formspree / Web3Forms / Getform). It is public by nature:
# never put a secret key here. Leave empty and the form falls back to opening
# WhatsApp with the message pre-filled.
# When you set it, add its origin to connect-src in the Content-Security-Policy
# in vercel.json, or the browser will block the request.
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=
